% Not in the Vatican II Hymnal; pitched in the Kyrie's key signature.
%%
(f3) I(e)te,(fh) mis(hg)sa(f) est.(g.) (::)
<sp>R/</sp>. De(e)o(fh) grá(hg)ti(f)as.(g.) (::)
